'''''Riccardia multifida''''' is a species of [[liverwort]] belonging to the family [[Aneuraceae]].<ref name="GBIF">{{cite web |title=Riccardia multifida (L.) Gray |url=https://www.gbif.org/species/2689535 |website=www.gbif.org |access-date=18 February 2021 |language=en}}</ref>

It has [[cosmopolitan distribution]].,<ref name="GBIF" /> widely found on both coasts of North America, Europe, and east Asia.<ref>{{Cite web |title=Riccardia multifida (L.) Gray |url=https://www.gbif.org/species/2689535 |access-date=2024-11-28 |website=www.gbif.org |language=en}}</ref>

